# SpeechLLm — environment template.
#
#     cp SpeechLLm/.env.example SpeechLLm/.env
#
# THERE ARE CURRENTLY NO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES. The service takes all of its
# configuration from `configs/models.yaml`, and nothing in the live import
# chain (api_server.py -> src/services/vieneu_client.py) reads os.environ at
# all. Copying this file is optional; it exists so that the absence is
# documented rather than guessed at.
#
# A test-only env-var bypass for model warm-up used to live in production
# code here. Removed on 11-09-2026: it was reachable from production through
# one stray environment variable, which is exactly the "/health answers ok
# while nothing is loaded" bug the warm-up mechanism exists to prevent.
# Tests now monkeypatch `api_server._warm_up_model` directly instead (see
# tests/SpeechLLm/conftest.py) — this module has no test-only branches left.
#
# This file previously declared ELEVENLABS_API_KEY as REQUIRED, and
# PHONEMIZER_ESPEAK_LIBRARY / COQUI_USE_GPU as options. All three belonged to
# `elevenlabs_client.py` and `coqui_client.py`, deleted on 10-09-2026 along with
# the rest of the retired pipeline. Setting them now does nothing.
#
# If you are looking for the switch that turns speech on or off, it is not here:
# it is VIENEU_TTS_URL in the LangGraph service's own environment
# (agenticRAG/.env). Unset there, the agent never calls this service.
